<section class="ex-note" id="overview">
<h2>1. Overview &amp; Classification（總論與分類）</h2>
<p>Primary immunodeficiency diseases 是遺傳性免疫系統疾病，使感染易感性、罹病率與死亡率上升；許多有皮膚表現，認出這些表現可能幫助早期診斷。<span class="ex-ref">p.2394</span></p>
<ul>
<li>皮膚異常可包括：cutaneous infections、atopic-like 或 seborrheic-like dermatitis、macular erythemas、alopecia、poor wound healing、purpura／petechiae、telangiectasias、pigmentary dilution、cutaneous granulomas、extensive warts、angioedema、lupus-like changes。<span class="ex-ref">p.2394</span></li>
<li>懷疑免疫缺陷：反覆感染且病程較長或較嚴重，尤其是 unusual organisms；可伴隨感染清不乾淨、非預期或嚴重併發症、抗生素反應差；嬰兒常 failure to thrive。<span class="ex-ref">p.2394</span></li>
<li>Classification：(a) antibody deficiencies、(b) cellular deficiencies、(c) combined antibody and cellular deficiencies、(d) disorders of phagocytosis and cell killing、(e) complement defects。<span class="ex-ref">p.2394</span></li>
<li>所有 genetic immunodeficiency 最重要的鑑別診斷是 <strong>HIV infection</strong>；HIV 病人傾向 inverted CD4-to-CD8 ratio 與 hypergammaglobulinemia，相對於許多遺傳性免疫缺陷的 hypogammaglobulinemia。<span class="ex-ref">p.2394</span></li>
</ul>
