<tr><td>Skin EM</td><td>Mature melanosomes 填滿 epidermal melanocytes</td><td>Same as GS1</td><td>Same as GS1</td><td>Reduced numbers of giant melanosomes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Leukocyte granules</td><td>None</td><td>None</td><td>None</td><td>Large, cytoplasmic</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 132-8，p.2416。</p>
<h3>Related differential diagnosis（相關鑑別）</h3>
<ul>
<li>銀髮也見於 Hermansky-Pudlak syndrome；hemophagocytic syndrome 要與 X-linked lymphoproliferative disorder、familial HLH、ALPS、IL-2R 突變區分。<span class="ex-ref">p.2417</span></li>
<li>Familial HLH：AR，hemophagocytosis 且無 NK-cell cytotoxicity，未早期移植傾向致命；基因 <em>PRF1</em>（perforin）、<em>UNC13D</em>、<em>STX11</em>、<em>STXBP2</em>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2417</span></li>
<li>ALPS（Canale-Smith syndrome）：Fas（CD95）、Fas ligand、caspase 8 與 10 基因；自體免疫（cytopenias、LCV、LE）、lymphoma 風險增加，circulating CD4−/CD8− α/β T cells 增加。<span class="ex-ref">p.2417</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="complement">
<h2>12. Complement Deficiency &amp; Hereditary Angioedema（補體缺乏與遺傳性血管性水腫）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Early complement components 缺乏或功能異常：與自體免疫疾病（尤其 SLE）相關，並有 encapsulated bacteria 感染風險；late components 缺乏明顯增加 neisserial infections 易感性。<span class="ex-ref">p.2419</span></li>
<li>HAE 幾乎都是 autosomal dominant，spontaneous mutation rate <strong class="ex-n">25%</strong>；1 in 150,000，無種族偏好；<strong class="ex-n">75%</strong> 有家族史。<span class="ex-ref">p.2419</span></li>
<li>Type I：C1 INH antigenic level 低，佔 <strong class="ex-n">85%</strong>；Type II：functional level 低但 antigenic level 正常或高；第三型沒有 C1 INH 缺乏，過去以為只影響女性，後來有家族三位男性受影響。<span class="ex-ref">p.2419</span></li>
<li>治療選項：attenuated androgens、antifibrinolytics、plasma-derived C1 INH、kallikrein inhibitor、bradykinin receptor antagonist；plasma-derived C1 INH 可急性治療或在頻繁發作、已知手術前預防使用。<span class="ex-ref">p.2420</span></li>
</ul>
